  "title": "Easy and Elegant Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "This main dish is beautiful in its presentation and always comes out tender and juicy even if you overcook it a little. The crust of bread crumbs holds in all the juices and adds a great look and taste to the finished product.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Burget"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-09-30T23:21:35-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-04-02T16:30:00-04:00",
